  "id": "aeq",
  "term": "AEq",
  "definition": "AEq refers to the Aesthetic Experience Questionnaire, a 22-item psychometric measure of aesthetic experience. It assesses emotional, cultural, perceptual, and understanding aspects of response to art, along with two flow-related aspects: conditions that support flow and the flow experience itself.",
